# update vs copier update

`update` / `devenv update` refresh **your** `devenv.lock` and optional
`update.local.sh`. Template tools (RTK, Serena, Headroom, 9Router, MCP
pins, debtmap) move only with `copier update`.

```
# ❌ BAD — fighting the next copier update
# home/llm-context.nix
braveSearchMcpVersion = "9.9.9";

# ✅ GOOD
copier update
# or bump *your* uv/npx tools in gitignored update.local.sh
```

Do not edit shipped `home/*-pkg.nix` or `home/llm-context.nix` version
strings to "upgrade" the stack. `devenv update` is the devenv CLI (flake
inputs). `update` is our script; it does not wrap that CLI.
